			// unfocused active 1.14:1, active 1.20:1. Inactive stays at the bar colour so only the
			// active tab carries a shape.
			//
			// `tab.selectedBackground` has to be set alongside `tab.activeBackground`: the active tab
			// is also the selected one, and that key wins. It does NOT inherit from
